    "objective": "Fix the existing lexer output-atomicity defect in src/lex.zig. The public lex contract says UnmatchedQuote and MissingArgumentSeparator failures yield no tokens, but a failure after a valid prefix currently leaves partial tokens in the caller-owned output list. Make every lex failure clear all partial output while preserving the exact existing error tags, successful tokenization, grammar, quoting, argv boundaries, and allocation ownership. Add a focused regression test in src/lex.zig. Use node .dsh-dsworker/lex-failure-atomicity-oracle.mjs for independent focused verification.",
